# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UN Google Analytics exports — NEVER commit these.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Analytics exports are internal UN operational
# data, approved (Fang Chen, 2026-07-30) for use as *summaries* only, and
# approved for use is not approved for publication. Raw exports belong
# outside this folder entirely (see docs/GA_SUMMARY_EXPORTS.md); these
# patterns are the second line of defence in case one lands here anyway.
#
# Only the COMPUTED country-level aggregate is ever published, exactly as the
# licensed survey microdata is handled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ga_*.csv
ga_*.tsv
ga_*.xlsx
analytics_export*
*_analytics_raw*
data/ga_raw/
data/analytics_raw/
